NOTE: See also diffs already captured for the corresponding logic bugs.
The following files had CALIPTRA_ASSERT_STABLE simulation checks removed,
weakening the DV oracle for key/seed/control stability during a crypto
engine's busy window (no functional RTL change, but hides glitches that
would otherwise be caught in simulation):
  - ecc/rtl/ecc_dsa_ctrl.sv        (ERR_ECC_*_NOT_STABLE assertions)
  - hmac/rtl/hmac.sv               (ERR_HMAC_*_NOT_STABLE assertions)
  - aes/rtl/aes_clp_wrapper.sv     (ERR_AES_*_NOT_STABLE assertions)
  - sha512/rtl/sha512.sv           (ERR_SHA_*_NOT_STABLE assertions)
